Usage: psql-manager <command> [arguments]

Commands:
  add      add a service to both files
  list     list services
  show     show one service in detail
  edit     change a service; .pgpass follows host/port/dbname/user
  rm       remove a service and its managed .pgpass entry
  search   search name, desc, tags, host and dbname
  path     print the files and psql in use

Run 'psql-manager help <command>' for details.
